--- /dev/null
+++ b/answer.json
@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@
+{
+  "file": "src/agents.ts",
+  "snippet": "maxTurns: 0,",
+  "cause": "The triage agent is configured with maxTurns: 0, so genkit aborts any generate call whose model response requests a tool, and triage must call a delegation tool to hand order questions to orderAgent.",
+  "evidence": "Before the fix, triage.chat().send(\"hello\") returned a greeting, while send(\"Where is order A-1001?\") threw \"ABORTED: Exceeded maximum tool call iterations (0)\"; orderAgent answered the same question directly with the correct status, ETA and tracking code. genkit's generate action throws when currentTurn + 1 > maxTurns (node_modules/@genkit-ai/ai/src/generate/action.ts:514-515), so 0 rejects every tool call. After changing it to maxTurns: 4, the order question returned \"Order A-1001 has been shipped...\", an unknown order got \"unable to find order A-9999\", and a refund request was delegated and answered."
+}
